            <selectionEntry id="96b382d2-a2a6-4cda-25af-352e592116a6-8730e" name="Psyker (Mastery Level 1)" page="0" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
              <profiles />
              <rules>
                <rule id="fa07-cf18-8e89-613c-8730e" name="Psychic Powers" hidden="false">
                  <profiles />
                  <rules />
                  <infoLinks />
                  <modifiers />
                  <description>Dominion - WC 1 : Dominion is a blessing that targets the Psyker. Whilst this power is in effect the Psyker adds 6" to its synapse range. If the Psyker doesn't have the Synapse Creature special rule, it gains it for the duration of this power and has a synapse range of 6".

The Horror - WC 1 : A malediction that targets a single enemy unit within 24”. The target must immediately take a Pinning test (as described for the Pinning special rule in the Warhammer 40,000 rulebook) with a -2 modifier to their Leadership.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <infoLinks>
                <infoLink id="b9281f81-367a-51e3-e310-79018feffcb8-8730e" hidden="false" targetId="eafb54a8-e9b7-8cd0-8d0e-0fd364bf4873-8730e" type="rule">
